title: 'C-c l p : skg-show-folderOf-flags'
pid: 54471aaf-ebc6-4321-ace6-1706eb942330
body: |2-
  Shows the write-protected =flagsFolder=. It lists only true node-file
  flags as titleless viewnodes whose heralds carry their labels, in canonical
  order, and remains visible when none are true.
  =Had ID before import= and =Was overloaded during org-roam import=
  are provenance; =No search matching= is the user setting. Edit none of these
  generated viewnodes directly. Delete the whole folder branch to dismiss this
  optional view; doing so does not change any flag.
